{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"8d27ce20c6bf812be1adbca20e1391741457245b75af15ad950196dffc21d9c2","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"20fa052d6c3f569c56a139a845e16a768b7b1562be6c5e92e0deed27395f1d63","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"The translation drops the relationship \"your ... patron\": the source says \"your mad patron sun\", but the translation only says 「疯狂的太阳」, so it no longer says the sun is the player's patron god. Source (tome@624a6732): chats/sorcerer-end.lua:66 \"bring forth your patron to Eyal\" and :104 \"Your mind is burnt by your patron sun! Fight for your sun god now!\". Both show the Distant Sun is the player's patron, and the Sher'Tul steps in because the player \"has been colluding with a god\" (:99). Suggest keeping \"your patron\", e.g. 「阻止你为自己疯狂的太阳主神开启传送门」."}]}